# Refresh (M8): F5 and Ctrl+Alt+R ask the engine to check every account for new mail now
# (Command::CheckMail), keeping its connections; the View menu and the palette offer it.
# Run: tools/headless.sh 19 target/debug/sealwax --self-test tests/selftest/refresh.sealwax-test

desktop tiling
resize 1440 900
engine-attach
mail-account Personal
folder inbox Personal
engine-expect folder-opened
action win.refresh
engine-expect check-mail
focus list
key F5
engine-expect check-mail
key <Control><Alt>r
engine-expect check-mail
